It's a garbage dump of a planet you princesses had no need to know about.

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:50.130
It's a planet in the Talha galaxy once used by the assassin syndicate.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:52.740
I remember seeing it in galaxy news.

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:58.470
A number of years ago, there was an incident where a planet was suddenly split in two as if cut in half by something.

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:00.930
That was planet Kild.

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:04.960
