00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.680
I couldn't stand to not cut it.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.860
But it was an incomplete awakening, after all.

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:44.230
The transformation wore off after only a few seconds,

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:49.060
