This is...

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:16.460
Mea's home.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:22.040
It looks like we were sent this far away by Yami-san's wormhole.

00:13:24.430 --> 00:13:26.200
That Mea...

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:29.650
The sweets she ate yesterday are still all over the place.

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:31.660
She's so hopeless.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:33.010
Nana...

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:38.100
