00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:13.560
I intended to leave your body when the time was right.

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:17.850
After Darkness has dealt with Yuuki Rito as she desires, of course.

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:20.820
We'll all get along well, won't we?

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:22.810
The three of us, as weapons.

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:26.860
W-What is with those clothes, Yami-chan?!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.270
They're wedged in!

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:29.220
Shameless!

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:30.380
K-Kotegawa!

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:31.610
Don't provoke her!

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:34.760
Yami is not herself right now!

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:37.120
Shameless?

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:41.070
That's the ultimate complement, Kotegawa Yui!

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:41.830
Eh?

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.840
Now, I wonder where this gate is connected...?

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:45.840
Huh?

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:47.770
The answer is...

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:55.930
What is this?!

00:15:59.650 --> 00:16:00.850
No!

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:04.830
Sairenji?

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:05.950
What's wrong?

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:06.570
Yami!

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:08.940
I don't know what you're doing, but stop it!

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:10.650
Why don't you try it, too?

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:20.370
Come on, there's no need to hold back!

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:26.880
No!

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:34.800
I-I can't breathe!

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.300
Oh, right.

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:40.050
At this rate, you'll be finished by Kotegawa Yui's body. {she says iku, implying both "to cum" and "to die" so I went with "finish", I think it works}

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:44.360
I have to make sure you finish with my body!

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:50.820
Please shower me with your hot blood!

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:51.690
Yami-chan?!

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:00.660
Ah...

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:03.580
That was close!

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:06.540
Lala-san!

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:08.730
There's no mistaking it, Lala-sama!

00:17:08.730 --> 00:17:12.350
The origin of the energy source I detected before is...!

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:14.170
What in the world is going on, Rito?

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:16.470
Y-Yami is...

00:17:16.850 --> 00:17:19.680
Darkness, Princess.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:23.990
This appearance is the ultimate trans, Darkness.

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:26.690
It will bring about chaos to the universe.

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:28.560
Darkness...?

00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:32.980
Lala!

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:34.820
Yami! Would you cut it out-

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:38.240
Princess Lala!

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:42.240
Now that I think of it, you're Yuuki Rito's fiancée, right?

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:44.750
Then, to me...

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:59.640
Is this trans...?

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:10.070
Even her golem is a Yuuki Rito type, huh?

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:12.780
It would seem she's fixated on him quite a bit.

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:14.540
Master...

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:15.310
Hm?

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:16.420
What is it, Mea?

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:17.950
Are you still trying to struggle?

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:20.540
Why don't you just quiet down already?

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:24.500
Trans Fusion can only be undone at my will.

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.030
It's true.

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:30.820
My power is being completely sealed off.

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:33.340
Your trans really is powerful, Master.

00:18:33.870 --> 00:18:35.350
I remember now.

00:18:35.350 --> 00:18:37.990
It's happened many times when I used Psycho Dive.

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:40.840
A sensation like I was becoming someone other than myself.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:45.740
A black abyss rising from the depths of my consciousness.

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:50.600
That was not me, but you, wasn't it Master?

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:53.180
As expected.

00:18:53.180 --> 00:18:55.110
As expected of my Master.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:57.570
But is it really okay?

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.100
What?

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:03.240
Rito-senpai was supposed to be your
favourite manservant, wasn't he, Master?

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:08.800
Are you okay with Yami-oneechan killing Rito-senpai like this, Master?

00:19:08.800 --> 00:19:10.910
Are you trying to persuade me?

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:11.750
That's not it!

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.710
I'm saying it for your sake, Master!

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:17.700
I'm thankful to you, Master.

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:22.090
Because you guided me, I wasn't alone, Master.

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:24.140
I was able to continue living.

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:27.420
But... I...

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:31.210
I don't want to see Yami-oneechan kill Rito-senpai!

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:40.860
Even if you don't want to see it, you have no way of escaping my spell.

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:44.470
Master...

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:48.860
Do you know about Memorzians?

00:19:49.940 --> 00:19:51.580
You do, right?

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:54.540
You saw it from inside me.

00:19:54.540 --> 00:20:00.050
When Memorzians become adults, they separate from each other as proof of it!

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:02.630
Are you saying you're going to separate from me?

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:07.560
I thought I told you, only I can release Trans Fusion.

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:13.310
It's true, it looks like I won't be able to do anything with only my own power.

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:15.550
But Master...

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:19.850
I have friends now.

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:20.940
What?

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:27.590
Even if my power is sealed, as long as I'm conscious I can at least move one strand of hair!

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:30.660
I'm here, Mea-san!

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.870
Telekinetic convergence!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:36.670
Murasame Shizu.

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:40.670
So she's trying to pull me out of Mea's body...?

00:20:41.190 --> 00:20:44.220
From the outside, Murasame-senpai's Telekinesis...

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:46.680
From the inside, my trans power...!

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:50.620
Even if it's impossible for one, with both of our power...!

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:11.080
Master... Thank you for everything up until now.

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:16.460
From now on, I'll choose my path for myself.

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.400
Mea...

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:23.720
It's the school!

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:25.720
I hope Rito-san is safe...!

